<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Thank you for your
interest in the biological design PhD program at Arizona State University. This
innovative, interdisciplinary degree is designed to develop a new type of
scientist — one equipped with both specialized expertise and the ability to
identify solutions for context-specific problems. The research emphasis focuses
on projects that contribute directly to solutions for important societal
challenges.</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br>
<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">The program features
include:<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">an individualized program of
     study that teaches a team approach<o:p></o:p></font></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">rotations through multiple
     research labs during the first year of study<o:p></o:p></font></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">opportunities to collaborate
     with faculty and students from across the university<o:p></o:p></font></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">faculty who encourage
     interdisciplinary research that is entrepreneurial and use-focused<o:p></o:p></font></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Applications for fall
admission should be submitted by Dec. 15 for priority review. In addition to
the general admission requirements, applicants must submit the following to the
Graduate College:</span></p>

<ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">an online application<o:p></o:p></font></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">official GRE scores<o:p></o:p></font></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">TOEFL scores, if applicable<o:p></o:p></font></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">resume or curriculum vitae<o:p></o:p></font></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">a statement of purpose<o:p></o:p></font></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">three letters of recommendation<o:p></o:p></font></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Further information and
instructions regarding how to apply can be found <a href="http://sbhse.engineering.asu.edu/biologicaldesign/"><span style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">here</span></a>.&nbsp;There are no minimum GRE
test scores required to gain entrance into the program, but scores should be
competitive to increase an applicant’s likelihood of acceptance. The average
GPA of admitted applicants this past year was 3.80, while the average GRE sub
scores were 152, 158 and 3.8 for verbal, quantitative and analytical,
respectively. The average TOEFL score for admitted students is 100. View
English proficiency requirements <a href="http://graduate.asu.edu/admissions/international/english_proficiency"><span style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">online</span></a>.</font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">With faculty mentors and
a personalized program of study, our students become part of a vibrant research
community.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">School of Biological and
Health Systems Engineering<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Advising&nbsp;480-965-3028
| Fax 480-727-7624<o:p></o:p></font></p>

